"weight:600;\">^</span> - Matches the beginning of a line</li>\n"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
